  m_Name: IntroPage_04
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroPageData
  pageTitle: Lost Technology
  pageBody: 'After a century of war, civilization forgot much of what it once knew.


    Old
    machines, rare metals, power cores, and forgotten weapons became more valuable
    than gold. City leaders began sending scavenger teams into the Junkyards to recover
    anything useful.'
